# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide demonstrates a minimal working example of the `qiskit-addon-pna` package. We use propagated noise absorption (PNA) to build a noise-mitigating observable. Given a circuit and a Pauli-Lindblad noise model, PNA classically propagates the observable through the inverse noise channel. Measuring the resulting observable on the noisy QPU mitigates the learned gate noise.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan contoh kerja minimal dari paket `qiskit-addon-pna`. Kita pakai propagated noise absorption (PNA) untuk membangun observable yang meredam noise. Diberikan sebuah circuit dan noise model Pauli-Lindblad, PNA merambatkan observable secara klasik melalui noise channel invers. Mengukur observable hasilnya pada QPU yang noisy akan memitigasi noise gate yang telah dipelajari.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see how to build a realistic workflow and run on quantum hardware with the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), including learning the noise model with `NoiseLearnerV3`, check out the [PNA tutorial](/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption) on the IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat cara membangun alur kerja yang realistis dan menjalankannya di hardware kuantum dengan [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), termasuk mempelajari noise model dengan `NoiseLearnerV3`, lihat [tutorial PNA](/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption) di IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Prepare the inputs for PNA {#1-prepare-the-inputs-for-pna}"
msgstr "1. Siapkan input untuk PNA {#1-prepare-the-inputs-for-pna}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "PNA takes as input a circuit, noise model, and observable. Here we build a 10-qubit Trotterized transverse-field Ising model on a 1D chain. We generate a random 2-local Pauli-Lindblad noise model for each entangling gate and embed it as a Qiskit Aer `PauliLindbladError` instruction just before that gate. We choose a weight-4 Pauli-Z observable to measure.\n"
msgstr "PNA menerima circuit, noise model, dan observable sebagai input. Di sini kita membangun model Ising medan transversal 10-qubit yang di-Trotterize pada rantai 1D. Kita membuat noise model Pauli-Lindblad 2-local acak untuk setiap gate entangling dan menanamkannya sebagai instruksi Qiskit Aer `PauliLindbladError` tepat sebelum gate tersebut. Kita memilih observable Pauli-Z berbobot 4 untuk diukur.\n"

