# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Generate the noise-mitigating observable {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "2. Hasilkan observable yang meredam noise {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propagates each Pauli generator of the inverse noise channel forward to the end of the circuit. The observable is then back-propagated through the inverse noise channel, returning a new observable $\\tilde{O}$. Three key parameters affect the computation cost:\n"
msgstr "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) merambatkan setiap generator Pauli dari noise channel invers maju sampai akhir circuit. Observable kemudian dirambatkan mundur melalui noise channel invers, menghasilkan observable baru $\\tilde{O}$. Tiga parameter kunci memengaruhi biaya komputasi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_err_terms`: the number of terms kept in each anti-noise generator as it is propagated forward.\n"
msgstr "`max_err_terms`: jumlah suku yang dipertahankan di setiap generator anti-noise saat dirambatkan maju.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_obs_terms`: the number of terms kept in $\\tilde{O}$.\n"
msgstr "`max_obs_terms`: jumlah suku yang dipertahankan di $\\tilde{O}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`atol`: terms with coefficient magnitude below this threshold are dropped.\n"
msgstr "`atol`: suku dengan magnitudo koefisien di bawah ambang ini dibuang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this small, near-Clifford circuit we set the term limits high and use a modest `atol`, so $\\tilde{O}$ stays small and we can measure all of its terms.\n"
msgstr "Untuk circuit kecil yang hampir Clifford ini, kita set batas suku tinggi dan memakai `atol` yang sedang, sehingga $\\tilde{O}$ tetap kecil dan kita bisa mengukur semua sukunya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "***Note: This function uses Python `multiprocessing`. When running as a script, call it inside an `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` guard.***\n"
msgstr "***Catatan: Fungsi ini memakai Python `multiprocessing`. Saat dijalankan sebagai script, panggil di dalam guard `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`.***\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Mitigate gate errors by measuring the noise-mitigating observable {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "3. Mitigasi error gate dengan mengukur observable yang meredam noise {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we see that the new observable effectively mitigates the gate noise affecting the experiment.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita lihat bahwa observable baru secara efektif memitigasi noise gate yang memengaruhi eksperimen.\n"

